{
  "_comment": [
    "Pins the project so `firebase deploy` cannot go somewhere else.",
    "Without this the CLI uses whichever project it last had selected, which is",
    "global to the machine and has nothing to do with this directory. On 27 Aug",
    "that sent firestore.rules to pfa-wildlife-rescue-e70bf and overwrote that",
    "project's rules with this site's.",
    "",
    "scripts/ship.sh additionally passes --project, taken from the service",
    "account key, so the rules always land on the same project the API and the",
    "sign-in use."
  ],
  "projects": {
    "default": "pfa-new-website"
  }
}
